                    "message": "@Fred.Chen@quantatw.com Does this mean we will have double PDB sensors https://grok.openbmc.org/xref/openbmc/entity-manager/configurations/meta/santabarbara_pdb2.json?r=33cac46b2fac15cb6f65b930e4f184991443b639#450 Or where ever we have EVB tray the individual PDB FRU won't show up or get discovered?"
