                        "username": "fredchenquanta"
                    },
                    "message": "Yes, PDB1+PDB2 and the EVB PDB2 will not exist at the same time. In the EVB tray, only the EVB PDB2 is installed, so there are no duplicate sensors and the individual PDB FRU will not appear."
